-- A record whose fields list their options inline
-- (specs/proposals/INLINE-ONE-OF-FIELD-SPEC.md). `l4 render` lists each
-- field's options under the field and prints no defined term for the type L4
-- makes for them; `l4 batch` re-prints the module in its lifted form
-- (`DECLARE `Plot's tenure` IS ONE OF …`) and runs it once per row.
DECLARE Plot HAS
    `the occupier` IS A STRING
    `tenure`       IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger TYPICALLY Owner
    `boundary`     IS ONE OF
        Fenced
        Hedged
        Open
    `status`       IS ONE OF Settled, Disputed
        MEANS IF boundary EQUALS Open THEN Disputed ELSE Settled

@export Whether a plot is lived in by its owner.
GIVEN p IS A Plot
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owner occupied` p IS
      p's tenure EQUALS Owner
  AND p's boundary EQUALS Fenced
